Main EA for USOIL automated trading. Input parameters: LotSize (0.01), StopLossPips (50), RiskRewardRatio (1.5), BreakevenPips (15), TrailingStartPips (20), TrailingStepPips (10), SRDistancePips (20), MinSentimentCount (7), Timeframe selection. Logic: Open BUY if ≥7/10 indicators >80 AND price >20 pips from resistance. Open SELL if ≥7/10 indicators <20 AND price >20 pips from support. Includes breakeven and trailing stop management.